From 6701ccc21b22e4e6378bc6f30c556dfe5f3a10bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zhymabek Roman <s.salkimbaev@abaiuniversity.edu.kz>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 14:03:50 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll/server: Implement basic ALPC port infrastructure
 (NtAlpcCreatePort et al)

Adds a working server-side ALPC port object (server/alpc.c) plus the
matching ntdll unix-side syscalls, wired through four new wineserver
requests: create_alpc_port, connect_alpc_port, accept_alpc_connection
and disconnect_alpc_port.

Implements NtAlpcCreatePort, NtAlpcConnectPort, NtAlpcAcceptConnectPort,
NtAlpcDisconnectPort and NtAlpcSendWaitReceivePort with a full
connect/accept handshake and bidirectional message passing between
client and server connection endpoints.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
